  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup packed brown sugar",
    "0.5 cup butter",
    "2 tablespoons water",
    "1 (29 ounce) can sliced peaches, drained",
    "12 (3/4 inch thick) slices day-old French bread",
    "5 eggs",
    "1 tablespoon vanilla extract",
    "1 pinch ground cinnamon, or to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/T1KqUVLA1Iw1qEkQZysIG39_tIA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-72662-grandmas-peach-french-toast-VAT-step-01-90304128e924497589cadc44af75a100.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/72662/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a saucepan, stir together the brown sugar, butter and water. Bring to a boil, then reduce heat to low, and simmer for 10 minutes, stirring frequently.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1OvMwptdIz02kplXNlvD70li3V8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-72662-grandmas-peach-french-toast-VAT-step-02-3f348190f400447494aa1188ebc0fc70.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/72662/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the brown sugar mixture into a 9x13 inch baking dish, and tilt the dish to cover the entire bottom. Place peaches in a layer over the sugar coating, then top with slices of French bread.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2PfDomgs8eq90lptFKtUF3dZ8HM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-72662-grandmas-peach-french-toast-VAT-step-03-b83e0e462758407580345b3fbe88190b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/72662/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a medium bowl, whisk together the eggs and vanilla. Slowly pour over the bread slices to coat evenly. Sprinkle cinnamon over the top. Cover and refrigerate for 8 hours or overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CG-Ba55vPO0Kd6AozJ9Btqq74vY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-72662-grandmas-peach-french-toast-VAT-step-04-8154ca2c8a39474cbe40290b71d483e8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/72662/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the dish from the refrigerator about 30 minutes before baking to come to room temperature. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zCWaiZnCYdHSc7p-1j6FB8RJd_Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-72662-grandmas-peach-french-toast-VAT-step-05-258630e8371c477fad4e00fe8ea925c6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/72662/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake for 25 to 30 minutes in the preheated oven, or until the bread is golden brown. Spoon out portions to serve.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/i4Uv3t-CkZy3UiyW5ja1C7iz7aQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-72662-grandmas-peach-french-toast-VAT-step-06-fc9b64ccfe4f47c5a22d768ea1047e79.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/72662/step_06.webp"
    }
  ],
